## Independent findings

I compared the frozen v1.0.0 contract recursively with type-aware equality. All source, roundtrip, physical behavior, full-log, report, manual, custody, scope, and launch-gate sections are identical. Changes are limited to version/package/run identity, selection, excluded-history reference, design revision, and an explicit publication policy. The original child input, export oracle, and parent/child report oracle byte pins remain those reviewed for v1.0.0. The prospective four-form log and 4,044-cell per-arm oracle remain hypotheses until a new sealed child run is reviewed.

The new selection preserves all 76 accepted local/base-Git source identities, 114 mandatory original raw byte pins, eight required documents, three installed assets, and separate CRLF/local versus LF/Git catalog identities. The audit rehashed the original files, read the base tree/blob objects by OID, and checked the new package is absent. It made no SSH, SIMLOX, accepted-checker, catalog, or Git mutation call.

The publication policy now names ordinary package-root author files and narrow inert preservation namespaces outside the execution-source freeze. It requires the final evidence index to close and pin every actual later path, including failed drafts, and default/dry rebuild to remain byte-identical after an authorized catalog append. These are prospective gates, not claims that a future builder already passes.

The v1.0.0 history records **zero actual case SSH preflights, zero native calls, and no GO_PRELAUNCH**. The prior independent approval was GO_PURE_PREFLIGHT only. The v1.0.0 routing NO_GO memo and its separate clarification addendum remain historical evidence; the addendum, 554 bytes/SHA-256 `f42df0d48f4b3d3e6bf42358af66ccd456e1f853c7f7a65cda530dbf7f596c66`, arrived after the 166-record snapshot and must receive a separate exact owned custody pin in the v1.0.1 package.

## Subsequent gates

Author construction may begin under the new version and run ID. Before any native launch, review the exact new source/runner/manifest and independent methods, freeze them, conduct an actual SSH session 0 PowerShell 5 `-File -PreflightOnly` with no native child, and issue a fresh receipt-bound GO_PRELAUNCH. No v1.0.0 preflight or approval is inherited. After a natural single child run, independent postrun, content, staged-byte, and remote-head reviews must verify the new publication policy against actual paths and immutable raw bytes.
